// Shared by parse_ident_or_call and parse_import (atom.id, import_expr.id):
// both read the current token's text and advance past it before doing
// anything else with the name. Neither of those files has room left for a
// fourth function, and this one does. A declaration's name is read here too,
// so a name that is a test-case keyword is refused in one place.
read_name(int[] pos) {
  no_case_word(pos);
  string name = cur_text(pos);
  advance(pos);
} return string name;
given atom_tokens ([0]):("foo")
